# Keep the reviewer build context small and deterministic.
#
# .git is deliberately NOT ignored: `make paper-evidence` verifies git state —
# a clean tracked worktree, the recorded evidence revision in history, and the
# evidence-v1 tag pointing at it. An image without .git cannot pass its own
# gate. No tracked file matches any pattern below, so the copied worktree stays
# byte-consistent with the copied index.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
coverage
cdk.out
.cache
artifacts
.terraform
**/.terraform
**/.terraform.lock.hcl
**/*.tfstate*
**/target
**/.DS_Store
*.log
__pycache__
**/__pycache__
docs/dissertation/.build
docs/dissertation/*.pdf
docs/dissertation/*.tex
